<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00004/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一张有沙发字样的A4纸，任何视线与其接触的智人会认为该项目是沙发，通过监控摄像头观看无效。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/04/01<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-10的休息室内<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">还在Site-CN-10的休息室内</span>被愤怒的Dr. Su撕毁，残骸被确认无异常性质。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>愚人节快乐——Dr. S73ven L1u<br />
████，S73ven你搞的让我一屁股坐地上了！——愤怒的Dr. L███████<br />
Dr. S73ven L1u 已受到惩罚——站点主管████</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00004" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00004" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00004-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drstevensliu" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5320644); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5320644&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607826071" alt="Drstevensliu" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5320644)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drstevensliu" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5320644); return false;">Drstevensliu</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1585711193 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">01 Apr 2020 03:19</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00389/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一辆严重损毁的2008款丰田RAV4<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-108801-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-108801-1')">1</a></sup>，任何进入该车驾驶舱内部的人类个体均会产生自身正在经历高速翻滚的错觉，且所有进入其内部的人类个体在离开该项目后均被检测出不同程度的脑震荡。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/8/31<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>杭州市一废车场<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>已被拆毁，残骸经确认无异常性质<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>可以想到这辆车出事前经历了什么</em>——Dr.Jackson</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00389" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00389" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00389-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/miku1314" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4546338); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4546338&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607826071" alt="miku1314" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4546338)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/miku1314" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4546338); return false;">miku1314</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1599314532 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">05 Sep 2020 14:02</span></p>
</div>
